        "raw_output": "\n\nThe goal is to move all groceries inside the cupboard and all mugs inside the box. Currently, mug2 is on the box_lid_top, blocking the lid from being opened. To access the box, mug2 must be moved first. After moving mug2, the box lid can be opened, allowing mugs to be placed inside. Similarly, spam and sugar (groceries) must be moved to the cupboard shelf. \n\n- First, mug2 is picked from box_lid_top and placed on table_center_area to clear the lid.  \n- Then, the box lid is opened, making inside_box accessible.  \n- Mug2 is picked again from table_center_area and placed inside inside_box.  \n- Mug1 is picked from table_right_area and placed inside inside_box.  \n- Mug3 is picked from cupboard_shelf and placed inside inside_box (since it was in the cupboard but must be moved to the box).  \n- Finally, spam and sugar are picked from table_right_area and placed on cupboard_shelf to move groceries inside the cupboard.  \n\nThis sequence ensures all mugs are inside the box and all groceries are inside the cupboard, satisfying the goal.\n\nFINAL ACTIONS:\npick(mug2)\nplace(mug2, table_center_area)\nopen(box_lid)\npick(mug2)\nplace(mug2, inside_box)\npick(mug1)\nplace(mug1, inside_box)\npick(mug3)\nplace(mug3, inside_box)\npick(spam)\nplace(spam, cupboard_shelf)\npick(sugar)\nplace(sugar, cupboard_shelf)",
